lang: bash
expect: certain
read:
  - line=2 member= key=covers value=src/bom.sh stamp= origin=comment
writable: 2
readonly: 
lookalikes: 
comments: 2
refuse: none
native: bash-n
note: bash gives a BOM no meaning: line 1 is the word U+FEFF'#' (a command), so it is NOT a comment; line 2 is. The BOM must survive every edit.
